    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that feels like such a cope though. like, we're just making up stories to distract ourselves from the fact that we're just biological accidents. if the universe is just cold, empty space and we're just here for a blink of an eye before everything goes dark again... it doesn't feel like \"creating meaning\" makes it any less of a trap. it feels more like we're just prolonging something that doesn't even matter.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
